SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Chora
LOCATION:Chora\, Sikinos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Sikinos's main summer panigiri\, for Agios Panteleimon: service at the chapel\, then dinner\, wine\, live music and dancing in which the whole village and its visitors join — in 2026 it was held at Pantanassa and the main square of Chora and ran on 29 July for practical reasons\, so the exact night can shift by a day or two\; check sikinos.gr. The island's few rooms fill in late July — book.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/sikinos/#chora-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-chora
